Subject: Default to system allocator and fix strcase pointer provenance under Fil-C
Policy-Class: P4-Audit
Rationale: Zend's 2 MiB chunk allocator hides intra-chunk overflows and UAF between PHP values; default USE_ZEND_ALLOC=0 under __FILC__ so every value gets its own capability, guard tracked_free_all() against integer-to-pointer frees (reclaimed by Fil-C GC), and compute res offsets from res instead of source in zend_str_tolower_dup_ex()/zend_string_tolower_ex().
Upstream-Status: Fil-C-Specific (strcase offset fix is upstreamable)
Fil-C-Origin-Commits: 18e0199cef6c30fc815442c0dd3f9d97fae3702a
Origin-Kind: filc-upstream
Origin-Project: pizlonator/fil-c
Origin-Commit: 18e0199cef6c30fc815442c0dd3f9d97fae3702a
Origin-URL: https://github.com/pizlonator/fil-c/commit/18e0199cef6c30fc815442c0dd3f9d97fae3702a

